Package: r-credit-fairness-lab
Title: R Rebuild of a Credit-Risk Champion with a Group Fairness Audit
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Script-based research project (not an installable package).
  This DESCRIPTION exists so renv can snapshot the exact dependency set:
  the tidymodels rebuild of the credit-risk-lab champion (glmnet ridge
  logistic regression, xgboost gradient boosting, mgcv GAM) on the UCI
  Taiwan credit data with the locked Python split replicated in R, plus
  the pre-registered fairness audit.
License: Apache-2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    tidymodels,
    glmnet,
    xgboost,
    mgcv,
    readxl,
    dplyr,
    tibble,
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    testthat,
